flowchart TD
    A1[Stage 1\n1_artifact_detection.py\nScan WSI zip -> detect artifacts -> write GeoJSON + SQLite progress]
    A2[Stage 2\n2_database_manager.py\nIngest cases -> extract Stage 2 patient shards -> update master_manifest.sqlite]
    A3[Stage 3\n3_pack_splits_to_hdf5.py\nObsolete\nFails closed with migration message]
    A41[Stage 4.1\n4_1_optimization_sampling.py\nRead canonical source HDF5 -> export pilot/master review overlays]
    A42[Stage 4.2\n4_2_tune_graph_method.py\nUse reviewed labels -> tune graph contamination parameters -> write JSON artifact]
    A43[Stage 4.3\n4_3_cleaner_script.py\nApply graph cleaning -> update accepted/rejected row state in master_manifest.sqlite]
    A5[Stage 5\n5_crossfold.py\nRead accepted rows -> assign TRAIN/VALIDATION/TEST -> fit TRAIN-only normalization -> write sidecars + SQLite split state]
    A6[Stage 6\n6_sanity_checks.py\nValidate Stage 5 sidecars, split integrity, leakage, and scientific semantics]
    A7[Stage 7\n7_smart_sampler.py\nRead TRAIN rows from master_manifest.sqlite -> select informative rows -> write sidecars + SQLite sampling state]
    A8[Stage 8\n8_lr_finder.py\nResolve TRAIN/VALIDATION once at startup -> load Stage 2 shards -> screen LR/loss settings -> report]
    A9[Stage 9\n9_training_ensemble.py\nResolve TRAIN/VALIDATION once at startup -> load Stage 2 shards -> train one model -> checkpoints + metadata]
    A10[Stage 10\n10_optimizer_ensemble.py\nResolve VALIDATION once at startup -> rank models -> optimize two-stream ensemble -> recipe JSON]
    A11[Stage 11\n11_inference_ensemble.py\nResolve TEST once at startup -> load Stage 2 shards -> run ensemble inference -> metrics + reports]

